  "body": "We seem to have missed the v1.6 release of the Matrix spec.\r\n\r\nhttps://spec.matrix.org/v1.6/\r\n\r\nWe need to support it fully and then advertise support for it in the client versions.\r\n\r\nWork to be done:\r\n- to be researched\r\n\r\nBlocks:\r\n- #15449 (because we don't advertise support for v1.6 and we removed the unstable prefixed version of `timestamp_to_event`, this API is currently 'unusable')",
